  partName: Left Rear Stud
  description: The Left Rear Stud is a tiny, complex-shaped part situated at the
    bottom-left-rear of the engine, fabricated from Material.001, serving as a threaded
    fastener for various engine components. Its precise location and material composition
    enable it to effectively distribute stress and loads. Notably, the Left Rear
    Stud's complex shape allows for a secure fit, preventing damage from vibration
    and movement.
